Boosting Performance & Security with AWS CloudFront

AWS CloudFront is a powerful Content Delivery Network (CDN) that helps deliver websites, APIs, videos, and static/dynamic content with low latency and high transfer speeds.

✨ Why CloudFront matters:
🌍 Global edge locations for faster content delivery
🔐 Built-in security with AWS Shield, WAF, and HTTPS
📉 Reduced load on origin servers
⚡ Seamless integration with S3, EC2, ALB, and Route 53
💰 Cost-effective scaling for global traffic

Whether you're building a high-availability web app, streaming content, or securing APIs, CloudFront plays a key role in creating fast, secure, and scalable cloud architectures.

📌 A must-have service for modern cloud and DevOps engineers.
